Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Import Wondershare Filmora projects (.wfp)

File > Import (and the Media Browser, and drag and drop) read Filmora 9+
projects: a ZIP whose timeline.wesproj is JSON in 100 ns units.

- every track in stacking order; video and audio clips with source in/out,
  placement, constant speed and reverse; video and audio of one source linked
- stills (Filmora's 3600 s source start) at source time zero
- titles (a text clip in a compound clip) as graphic clips with a text layer:
  text, font, size, colour, alignment and position
- other compound clips as nested sequences; self-containing ones refused
- Transform to Motion (position, scale, rotation), clip volume and mute, audio
  fades, transitions with their range
- effects, colour adjustments, masks, pan-and-zoom, speed ramps and AI
  features go to the import report
- minimal bounded ZIP reader (stored and deflate via miniz_oxide)

